=== Create tables for LEFT JOIN tests ===



=== Test 1: Basic LEFT JOIN with SUM ===
== Query ==
SELECT p.p_name, SUM(c.c_value)
FROM parent AS p
LEFT JOIN child AS c ON c.c_parent_id = p.p_id
GROUP BY p.p_name;

Number of output lines, including header: 6

== Diff ==
==========



== Expected result ==
SELECT p.p_name, SUM(c.c_value)
FROM parent AS p
LEFT JOIN child AS c ON c.c_parent_id = p.p_id
GROUP BY p.p_name|
p_name	SUM(c.c_value)
Alice	300
Bob	300
Charlie	900
Diana	NULL
Eve	NULL


