=== Test 6: Mixed INNER + LEFT JOIN ===
== Query ==
SELECT p.p_name, SUM(g.g_qty)
FROM parent AS p
JOIN child AS c ON c.c_parent_id = p.p_id
LEFT JOIN grandchild AS g ON g.g_child_id = c.c_id
GROUP BY p.p_name;

Number of output lines, including header: 4

== Diff ==
==========



== Expected result ==
SELECT p.p_name, SUM(g.g_qty)
FROM parent AS p
JOIN child AS c ON c.c_parent_id = p.p_id
LEFT JOIN grandchild AS g ON g.g_child_id = c.c_id
GROUP BY p.p_name|
p_name	SUM(g.g_qty)
Alice	15
Bob	15
Charlie	20


